{"4172970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "One Last Push", "steam_appid": 4172970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >September 1914. Germany has invaded! WAR!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been called to the front to defend France and push the invaders back to their homeland. Will you do your duty, or just try to survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/6f7cf11b01d01aad9913091519e14bef.poster.avif?t=1780833001\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/6f7cf11b01d01aad9913091519e14bef.webm?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/6f7cf11b01d01aad9913091519e14bef.mp4?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over By Christmas?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through procedurally generated warzones inspired by the Marne, Verdun, the Somme and Meuse–Argonne. Each push forward brings new dangers, dwindling supplies, and the haunting feeling that victory is always <i>one more push</i> away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make The Difficult Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re only human. <strong>Rations won’t last forever.</strong> Loot the fallen for essentials...or shake down your comrades for gifts from home. Every decision has a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/15638f82741a201ab65816d797f84f88.poster.avif?t=1780833001\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/15638f82741a201ab65816d797f84f88.webm?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/15638f82741a201ab65816d797f84f88.mp4?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gear Up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win favour with your superiors to <strong>earn reinforcements</strong> and <strong>expand your squad.</strong> Use your hard-fought loot to <strong>trade for weapons and gear</strong> at the armoury. Every advantage might mean the difference between life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go Over The Top!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge the trenches, face the chaos, and prove you’re the soldier who can end this war. At least that's what you said in your letter back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/aaeabda1cc995cf1806c0a7968312d35.poster.avif?t=1780833001\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/aaeabda1cc995cf1806c0a7968312d35.webm?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/aaeabda1cc995cf1806c0a7968312d35.mp4?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >War is Hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brutal <strong>PvE survival shooter</strong> where you manage your <strong>sanity, squad, and supplies</strong> to survive the unrelenting nightmare of WW1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/bcca30443bc8dd26a58c1505138efa6e.poster.avif?t=1780833001\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/bcca30443bc8dd26a58c1505138efa6e.webm?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/bcca30443bc8dd26a58c1505138efa6e.mp4?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you survive one more push?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wishlist Now</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >September 1914. Germany has invaded! WAR!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been called to the front to defend France and push the invaders back to their homeland. Will you do your duty, or just try to survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/6f7cf11b01d01aad9913091519e14bef.poster.avif?t=1780833001\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/6f7cf11b01d01aad9913091519e14bef.webm?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/6f7cf11b01d01aad9913091519e14bef.mp4?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over By Christmas?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through procedurally generated warzones inspired by the Marne, Verdun, the Somme and Meuse–Argonne. Each push forward brings new dangers, dwindling supplies, and the haunting feeling that victory is always <i>one more push</i> away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make The Difficult Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re only human. <strong>Rations won’t last forever.</strong> Loot the fallen for essentials...or shake down your comrades for gifts from home. Every decision has a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/15638f82741a201ab65816d797f84f88.poster.avif?t=1780833001\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/15638f82741a201ab65816d797f84f88.webm?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/15638f82741a201ab65816d797f84f88.mp4?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gear Up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win favour with your superiors to <strong>earn reinforcements</strong> and <strong>expand your squad.</strong> Use your hard-fought loot to <strong>trade for weapons and gear</strong> at the armoury. Every advantage might mean the difference between life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go Over The Top!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge the trenches, face the chaos, and prove you’re the soldier who can end this war. At least that's what you said in your letter back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/aaeabda1cc995cf1806c0a7968312d35.poster.avif?t=1780833001\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/aaeabda1cc995cf1806c0a7968312d35.webm?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/aaeabda1cc995cf1806c0a7968312d35.mp4?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >War is Hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brutal <strong>PvE survival shooter</strong> where you manage your <strong>sanity, squad, and supplies</strong> to survive the unrelenting nightmare of WW1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/bcca30443bc8dd26a58c1505138efa6e.poster.avif?t=1780833001\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/bcca30443bc8dd26a58c1505138efa6e.webm?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/extras/bcca30443bc8dd26a58c1505138efa6e.mp4?t=1780833001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you survive one more push?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wishlist Now</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Survive the horrors of WW1 in this intense PvE survival shooter. Scavenge supplies, earn your regiment’s respect, and fight for reinforcements before you become another name lost in the mud.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/47906657311f6093bae76d0f22f60aaf1a3b41bb/header.jpg?t=1780833001", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/b3313d4fa540b475d302d94430119b257f8656eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780833001", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172970/b3313d4fa540b475d302d94430119b257f8656eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780833001", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-3570K 3.4 GHz 4 Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 (2GB)<br></li><li